# Sprints directory

Each sprint's documents (brainstorm, spec, plan, review) go in a subdirectory named after the feature:
docs/sprints/
smoke-test-vultr-integration/
brainstorm.md
spec.md
plan.md
review.md
audit-log-package/
brainstorm.md
...

This file exists only to keep the directory tracked by git. Delete it if it becomes a nuisance.
